      "description": "#### Title\n\n* Enter text using standard characters.\n* Enter a concise text string (e.g., \"How to Optimize Your Workflow\").\n\n#### Slug\n\n* Enter lowercase text with hyphens in place of spaces (e.g., \"optimize-workflow\").\n* **Avoid:**\n   Spaces, special characters, or uppercase letters.\n\n#### Image\n\n* Upload a high-quality image file in JPG, PNG, or WebP format.\n* **Recommended:**\n   Minimum resolution of 800x800 px with a clear, uncluttered background.\n\n#### Author\n\n* Select the author from a provided drop down list.\n\n#### Date\n\n* Use a date format (e.g., MM-DD-MM-YYYY).\n\n#### Category\n\n* Select an option from a predefined dropdown list.\n\n#### Tags\n\n* Enter individual tag names as text.\n* **Process:**\n   Type a tag name and press \"Enter\" to add it (e.g., type \"innovation\" and press Enter, then type \"tech\" and press Enter).\n\n#### Short Description\n\n* Enter a concise text description (one or two sentences).\n\n#### Content\n\n* Enter rich text using a text editor that supports formatting options (e.g., headings, lists, bold text).\n* Use paragraphs and bullet points for readability.",
